<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Holy Shout</h1>
<p>Sphere: Divine Sphere
Spell Tier: 4
Class: Paladin (guild level 160)
Mana: 35
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>cast holy shout &lt;target&gt;
<a cmd='#'>cast holy shout</a>   (at whoever you are fighting)
</pre>
<p>The strongest of the paladin's prayers against evil: the paladin shouts the 
liturgy of the gods and grasps the target. Any target whose alignment is 
below neutral can be struck, and is hurt hard; the truly evil are hurt 
more. On the good and the neutral, nothing happens. The better your divine 
power and sphere, the more it hurts. It does about as well against any 
armour, and since the paladin grasps the target, a shield can block it.
</p><p>Casting it is an attack and starts a fight. It is also found on scrolls.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Holy Word</a>
